      "text": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<h3>Connect Tech at a Glance</h3>\r\n<p>Connect Tech builds deploy-ready boards and rugged systems for edge AI, vision, and networking. The Connect Tech products portfolio spans NVIDIA® Jetson carriers, camera platforms, embedded Ethernet switches, COM-HPC and COM Express carriers, plus accessories and thermal solutions. Macnica Americas distributes and supports Connect Tech solutions with local engineering, supply chain scale, and custom design services.</p>\r\n",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "container_falcon": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
    "cq:styleIds": [
     "1717498052331",
     "1717498053499"
    ],
    "title_textwithimage": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "jcr:title": "Falcon Vehicle System",
     "type": "h1",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
    },
    "textwithimage": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/dhw/pt/connect-tech/images/car.png",
     "imageRatio": "40",
     "alt": "an off-road car",
     "text": "<p>The Falcon Vehicle System is a production-ready, IP67-rated edge AI compute platform powered by NVIDIA Jetson Orin NX - purpose-built for agriculture, construction, and mining vehicles. Fanless and fully sealed, Falcon mounts directly on heavy equipment and supports up to four GMSL2 cameras, dual T1 Ethernet, and CAN interfaces for seamless vehicle integration. Launched at CONExpo 2026 and named Best-in-Show at embedded world Germany 2026 in AI and Machine Learning, Falcon is market-validated and ready for deployment.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/content/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/connect-tech/connect-tech-falcon-vehicle-system-ip67-edge-ai-for-heavy-equipment/\">Learn more</a></p>",
     "displayPopupTitle": "true",
     "linkTarget": "_self",
     "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
     "isDecorative": "false",
     "textIsRich": "true",
     "altValueFromDAM": "false",
     "cq:styleIds": [
      "1718154328384",
      "",
      ""
     ],
     "spImage": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/dhw/pt/connect-tech/images/car.png",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/image"
     }
    }
   },
   "container_326214469": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/container",
    "backgroundColor": "#f0f0f0",
    "cq:styleIds": [
     "1717498052331",
     "1717498053499"
    ],
    "title": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "jcr:title": "Why Connect Tech Solutions with Macnica?",
     "type": "h1",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
    },
    "text": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "text": "<div><span style=\"font-size: 13.125px;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fast path from dev kit to deployable hardware across Jetson Thor, AGX Orin, Orin NX, and legacy modules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Vision-first I/O including MIPI CSI-2, FPD-Link III, GMSL, SDI, and HDMI capture</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rugged options for harsh environments, IP-rated designs, locking I/O</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Embedded Ethernet from 1 GbE to managed 10 GbE</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Software support with CTI-L4T BSPs aligned to NVIDIA JetPack</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3>Where It Fits</h3>\r\n<p>Robotics, AMR, inspection, traffic and smart city, defense ISR, agriculture, construction, and autonomous machines</p>\r\n<h3>Get Started</h3>\r\n<p>Tell us your module target, camera stack, and I/O needs. We will align a carrier or system, plus thermal, cabling, and BSP.</p>\r\n",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
     "textIsRich": "true"
    }
   },
